			<div class="content" id="post-content-1940436">
									

<p>Many thanks to MrCarbon, Eskobar, Ghostchibi, Devereaux, Soulless, Tuomey, Voct, and Jekeled for helping me with this on chat!</p>
<p>This has been sitting in my head for awhile, and is partially thanks to Tarado, whose <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/forum/t-721359#post-1887605">draft thread</a> led to me coming up with the idea. Numerology has always been something I’ve been superstitious about, and there’s <a href="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Numbers_in_Chinese_culture">plenty of information out there</a> and several instances of people who go to pretty crazy lengths for lucky numbers.</p>

							</div>

								
